{"title":"Career roadmap · NGO Program Officer","role":"NGO Program Officer","summary":"An NGO Program Officer plans, coordinates, implements, monitors and reports social-development programmes. The role may cover areas such as education, healthcare, livelihoods, gender, child development, environment, human rights, rural development, governance and community development.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career alignment"},{"type":"p","text":"An NGO Program Officer plans, coordinates, implements, monitors and reports social-development programmes. The role may cover areas such as education, healthcare, livelihoods, gender, child development, environment, human rights, rural development, governance and community development."},{"type":"p","text":"A BA in Political Science provides a strong foundation in government, public policy, institutions, governance, constitutional systems, political economy and public administration. To become highly employable, this should be combined with programme management, monitoring & evaluation (M&E), research, data analysis, fundraising and field implementation skills."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Roles","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"NGO Intern, Program Assistant, Field Coordinator"},{"text":"Field implementation and documentation"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"Program Associate, Program Officer"},{"text":"Programme execution"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"Senior Program Officer, Program Manager"},{"text":"Programme ownership"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Senior Program Manager, State Program Manager"},{"text":"Multi-location programmes"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Program Director, State/Regional Head"},{"text":"Strategy and programme portfolio"}],[{"text":"Senior Leadership"},{"text":"Director – Programs, Head of Programs"},{"t